<title>USA: AMT Industries hires investment bank.</title>
<headline>AMT Industries hires investment bank.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMT Industries Inc said Tuesday its board hired investment bank Robinson-Humphrey Co to help the company develop strategic alternatives and evaluate merger and acquisition opportunities.</p>
<p>AMT, a Texas-based manufacturer of automated teller and cash security products, said it specifically sought assistance in maximizing the potential of its Tidel Engineering Inc unit.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
